       BASIS_SET DZVP-MOLOPT-SR-GTH
       POTENTIAL GTH-PBE
    &END KIND
    &KIND N
       BASIS_SET DZVP-MOLOPT-SR-GTH
       POTENTIAL GTH-PBE
    &END KIND
    &KIND Na
       BASIS_SET DZVP-MOLOPT-SR-GTH
       POTENTIAL GTH-PBE
    &END KIND
    &KIND Nb
